Package: gAtoms
Type: Package
Title: Structural Atom Decomposition of Undirected Graphs
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Heng", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "peiheng@nenu.edu.cn")
Description: Decomposes simple undirected graphs using a C implementation of
    recursive atom decomposition and clique minimal separator expansion built
    on a bundled, statically linked copy of the igraph C library 1.0.1.
    Provides deterministic perfect orderings, component
    trees, vertex mappings, residuals and validated structural S3 objects for
    sparse or dense graph inputs. Fits fixed-graph Gaussian concentration
    models by combining local atom estimates and complete separator estimates.
    Fits graphical log-linear models from categorical observations using local
    sufficient margins and factorized distributions without a global table.
    Computes decomposition-aware G-Wishart log normalizing constants, using
    exact closed forms for complete prime components and clique separators and
    optional BDgraph Monte Carlo for incomplete prime components.
